# OKF (project)

Before architecture, schema, ACL, deploy, or similar domain work:

1. Read `okf/index.md`, then the relevant domain index and concepts
2. Follow hard rules in `AGENTS.md` over OKF when they conflict — fix OKF if it drifts
3. After behavioral changes: update concepts + `okf/log.md` in the same change
4. Run the project OKF validator before merge

Skip for pure typos / UI cosmetics with no behavioral change.

Harness playbooks (portable): OKF Consume and Maintain, OKF Changelog, Rules Precedence.
